	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Salvus a te proxime domum redii, multa autem incommoda reperii, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sarciendis binos fere menses trivi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Erant enim casus adeo difficiles, ut etiam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>illis recte consulendis sedem meam ex <placeName ref="l245">Kauffburna</placeName> movere coactus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>fuerim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Concessi igitur ad amicum <persName ref="p20620">Iacobum Rehlinger</persName> in <placeName ref="l283">Ledere</placeName> duo <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>milliaria a <placeName ref="l245">Kaufburn</placeName> <placeName ref="l619">Bavariam</placeName> versus situato.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Animus quidem fuit <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vestras oras propius adire, sed instans hiemis dissuasit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hereo nunc hic <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>plane incertus, quo me tandem vertam, ut stabilior mihi meisque sedes sit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Papatus hic in dies magis atque magis pennas resumit, volare tamen plene <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nondum potest, quia bella ingruescentia consilio <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentino</placeName> spiritum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>imploratum impediunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Cum essem <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> et in vicinio, cum bonis quibusd<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>am de domicilio conveniente mihi consultavi oravique nonnullos, ut me <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quamprimum, si quid e re me[a] explorassent, propriis impensis certiorem facerent; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sed hactenus nihil percepi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Inter regrediendum nuper pernoctavi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l414">Rinegkii</placeName>, qui locus cum sit <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> cum aliis <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> ratione imperii <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>communis, etsi alioqui parum plausibilis, mihi satis arrisit, ut vel vitę meę <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>dies istic transigerem, et nisi monachos vicinos abhorruissem, certe nunc <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>illic pedem fixissem, donec facultas perseverandi mihi contigisset.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tu si <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quid per alios expiscari poteris, quod ad commorationem facturum esse putas, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>rescribe mihi.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2465">Hieronimus Papius</persName> <placeName ref="l291">Lyndoviensis</placeName> literas percepturus atque <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ad me missurus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>De Confederatorum dissensione hic multa sparguntur; utinam sint vana.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Hospites nostri appropinquant <placeName ref="l2528">lacui Podamico</placeName> aut fame pressi aut insidiis.<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>.. diosi:<note type="margin">a.R.: studiosi?</note></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Cęsar <persName ref="p18538">Carolus</persName> noster <placeName ref="l232">Oeniponti</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><placeName ref="l232">Innsbruck</placeName>.</note> agit, ubi et ipsum hibernaturum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>esse ferunt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">De rumoribus bellicis adeo hic nihil ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> et <placeName ref="l832">Galliis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>habemus, ut etiam ignoremus, quid <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgi</placeName> fiat, an obsessio adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>duret necne.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Quid futurum sit cum abbate <persName>Ioachimo</persName> in aedibus tuis relicto, ex te scire <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>valde desydero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p8441">Caspar Schwenckfeld</persName> ędidit librum, in quo tractat locos scripturę et pręsertim <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>de litera et spiritu, cui multi ex vulgo subscribunt; vernacula enim lingua <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>conscriptus est, qui propter rempublicam christianam apologia egere omnino <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>videtur.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Redolet porro novam theologiam, utinam non heresim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Si liber is ad <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>oculos tuos nondum pervenit, fac, sciam, et percepturus es.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Dominum <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName>, <persName ref="p7228">Zvinglium</persName>, <persName ref="p1283">Gessnerum</persName>, <persName ref="p1214">Frisium</persName>, <persName ref="p3988">Gvolfium</persName>, universos denique bonos, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>pręcipue dominos consules et archigrammateum salute plurima impertito.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>cum domo tua honestissima.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">27. novembris ex <placeName ref="l283">Leder</placeName> 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Tuus ut suus <persName ref="p8354">Georgius Lętus</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem erwirdigen unnd hochgelerten <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>herrn <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullinger</persName>, vorgeern<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Antistes.</note> der <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>kilchen <placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>, minem groß<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>gunstigen, lieben herren.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zu[rch]</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
